# `cloud_in` must be provided by the user
#
# `cluster_tolerance`, `min_cluster_size`, and `max_cluster_size`
#    do not need to be set by default unless the ROS2 param 
#    `${node_name}/use_params` is set to false. `use_params` defaults
#    to true on node startup.
#
#  If `use_params` is true, the default values shown here will be the
#    default values of the ROS2 parameters. Changing these values in this
#    message will have no effect. Modify the corresponding ROS2 parameter on
#    the node to change this.
#  If `use_params` if false, these fields will be used and the ROS2 parameters
#    on the node will not.

sensor_msgs/PointCloud2 cloud_in
float64 cluster_tolerance 0.02
uint32 min_cluster_size 100
uint32 max_cluster_size 25000
---
sensor_msgs/PointCloud2[] cloud_list_out
